    "No supplier-specific or supplier-group flow is an all-partner import total. Require an independently documented all-source aggregate before coverage eligibility; never sum partners.",
    "Product 78 specifically names imports from OPEC; it must never be treated as all-source OECD imports.",
    "All existing normal international product/activity definitions and original source quotations remain unchanged.",
    "Unknown or changed metadata blocks classification; no loose text fallback."
